alse,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,70,43,31,46,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1001615","armor":"WP1002805","helmet":"WP1021805","shield":"WP1001715"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1054","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,70,43,31,46,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1001615","armor":"WP1002805","helmet":"WP1021805","shield":"WP1001715"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1054","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,70,43,31,46,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1001615","armor":"WP1002805","helmet":"WP1021805","shield":"WP1001715"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10341","city":"CS1054","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[67,70,43,31,46,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1001615","armor":"WP1002805","helmet":"WP1021805","shield":"WP1001715"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1033002","name":{"zh":"称霸江东","en":"Dominion over Jiangdong"},"year":"196","month":"9","desc":{"zh":"退刘繇、纳名士，江东小霸王的威名传遍江南，如今的小霸王可不会轻易停下脚步...\n\n触发条件：孙策、王朗、严白虎存活。建业属孙策、会稽属王朗、吴属严白虎。\n\n禁忌条件：主角是蒋钦、周泰、陈武、凌操、凌统、严白虎、王朗时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【身属孙策势力】","en":"Having repelled Liu Yao and recruited illustrious scholars, the renown of the Little Conqueror of Jiangdong echoes across the land south of the Yangtze. Now, the Little Conqueror will not easily halt his stride...\n\n\n\nTrigger Condition: Sun Ce, Wang Lang, and Yan Baihu are alive. Jianye belongs to Sun Ce, Huiji belongs to Wang Lang, and Wu belongs to Yan Baihu.\n\n\n\nIncompatible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Jiang Qin, Zhou Tai, Chen Wu, Ling Cao, Ling Tong, Yan Baihu, or Wang Lang.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Belong to Sun Ce's Faction】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"原为江东一带的山贼，自称东吴德王，占据吴郡。吸纳山越部落与流亡农民，鼎盛时拥兵万余。孙策前来进攻时命严舆迎战，失败后遣其前去谈判，不和，弃城而逃往会稽，投靠王朗。王朗又败于孙策后逃往余杭，途中被孙策大将董袭所杀，首级被献于孙策。","tc":"原為江東一帶的山賊，自稱東吳德王，占據吳郡。吸納山越部落與流亡農民，鼎盛時擁兵萬余。孫策前來進攻時命嚴輿迎戰，失敗后遣其前去談判，不和，棄城而逃往會稽，投靠王朗。王朗又敗于孫策后逃往余杭，途中被孫策大將董襲所殺，首級被獻于孫策。","en":"Originally a bandit of the Jiangdong region, he proclaimed himself the ‘Virtuous King of East Wu’ and held Wu Commandery. He absorbed Shanyue tribes and displaced peasants, commanding over ten thousand troops at his peak. When Sun Ce attacked, he ordered Yan Yu to engage him. After being defeated, he sent Yan Yu to negotiate, when talks broke down, he abandoned the city and fled to Huiji to seek refuge with Wang Lang. After Wang Lang was also defeated by Sun Ce, he fled toward Yuhang, but was slain along the way by Sun Ce's general Dong Xi, who presented his severed head to Sun Ce.","jp":"もとは江東一帯の山賊。「東呉徳王」を自称して呉郡を占拠した。山越の部族や流民となった農民を吸収し、全盛期には１万余りの兵を擁した。孫策が攻め寄せてくると厳輿に迎撃を命じるも敗れ、その後、厳輿を講和交渉に遣わすも決裂。城を捨てて会稽へと逃れ、王朗を頼った。王朗もまた孫策に敗れると余杭へ逃走したが、その途上で孫策配下の大将・董襲に討ち取られ、首級は孫策へと献じられた。","kr":"본래 강동 일대의 산적 출신으로, 스스로 동오덕왕이라 칭하며 오군을 점거했다. 산월 부족과 유랑민을 규합하여 전성기에는 만여 명의 군사를 거느렸다. 손책이 침공해 오자 엄여를 보내 맞서 싸우게 했으나 패하였고, 이후 엄여를 보내 담판을 짓게 했으나 결렬되자 성을 버리고 회계로 달아나 왕랑에게 의탁했다. 왕랑마저 손책에게 패하자 여항으로 도주하던 중 손책의 대장 동습에게 목숨을 잃었으며, 그 수급은 손책에게 바쳐졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"62","id":"WJ10341","remark":"","surname":"严","surnameTc":"嚴","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"厳","surnameKr":"엄","surnameOther":"","name":"白虎","nameTc":"白虎","nameEn":"Baihu","nameJp":"白虎","nameKr":"백호","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"严白虎","power":"WJ10341","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecru